SUMMARY:Friday Nights at OMCA with MacArthur Maze | 60th Anniversary of the
  Black Panther Party
LOCATION:Oakland Museum\, 1000 Oak St\, Oakland\, CA 94607
DESCRIPTION:Live Performance by MacArthur Maze\, Music Set by DJ Black Woma
 n™\, Live Figure Drawing with Sketchboard Co.\, and Gallery Chats This F
 riday Night at OMCA\, the Museum is excited to be part of a series of prog
 ramming celebrating the 60th Anniversary of the Black Panther Party\, brin
 ging together music\, film\, storytelling\, and community throughout the e
 vening. On the Garden Stage\, East Bay Hip-Hop ensemble MacArthur Maze tak
 es the stage. Featuring four emcees and special guests Loove Moore and DJ 
 Kream\, the group delivers a distinctly Bay Area sound rooted in real-life
  storytelling\, love\, and community.\nhttps://museumca.org/event/friday-n
 ights-at-omca-with-macarthur-maze-60th-anniversary-of-the-black-panther-pa
 rty/\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://museumca.org/event/friday-nights-at-omca-with-macarthur-maze-60
 th-anniversary-of-the-black-panther-party/
END:VEVENT
