SUMMARY:Friday Nights at OMCA with DATANAGAN
LOCATION:Oakland Museum\, 1000 Oak St\, Oakland\, CA 94607
DESCRIPTION:Live Music by DATANAGAN\, DJ Set by MAMA SAN\, K-Pop Dance Less
 on with Ronnie\, Community Tabling: YOUth Decide\, and Gallery Chats Frida
 y Nights at OMCA brings a fresh\, genre-fluid sound to the Garden Stage as
  Bay Area singer-songwriter Victoria Datanagan leads DATANAGAN in an elect
 ric live performance of all-original music. Blending raw\, melodic storyte
 lling with a massive\, danceable sound\, the Filipina artist creates a com
 munal and deeply alive experience that invites audiences to connect\, move
 \, and let loose.\nhttps://museumca.org/event/friday-nights-at-omca-with-d
 atanagan/\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://museumca.org/event/friday-nights-at-omca-with-datanagan/
END:VEVENT
